## Commensurate stacking within confined ultramicropores boosting acetylene storage capacity and separation efficiency
Zhenghui Huang<sup>1</sup>, Kungang Chai<sup>1</sup>, Chengjun Kang<sup>2</sup>, Rajamani Krishna<sup>3</sup> (✉), and Zhaoqiang Zhang<sup>2</sup> (✉)
